  "label": "racist audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that holds or is sympathetic to racist ideologies, particularly those who seek to justify or minimize racially motivated violence by dehumanizing victims. The target community includes individuals who may benefit from or be attracted to the toxic framing that equates the killing of people of color with the killing of non-human entities (zombies), thereby downplaying the moral and legal significance of race in homicide.",
